## The test — CREATE THE NEW FILE `Blockchain/Dev/services/auth/src/__tests__/ks623-test-token-env-guard-is-asymmetric.test.ts`

**Harness:** `vitest run` inside `Blockchain/Dev/services/auth` (`package.json` scripts.test is `vitest`; setupFiles
